<main class="image-studio">
  <header class="studio-header">
    <div><p class="image-eyebrow">IMAGE WORKSHOP · AGENTX</p><h1>From idea to image.</h1>
      <p>Describe your image, check your brief, then create. You can review and improve the result. <a class="studio-guide-link" href="/images/guide">How it works, and a few tips →</a> <a class="studio-guide-link" href="/images/labo/">The lab: compare and understand →</a></p></div>
  </header>
  <nav class="image-journey" aria-label="Creation journey">
    <a href="#image-prompt"><span>01</span> Describe and prepare</a>
    <a href="#image-review"><span>02</span> Check and create</a>
    <a href="#image-result"><span>03</span> Review and improve</a>
  </nav>
  <div class="image-layout">
    <section class="image-compose" aria-labelledby="image-compose-title">
      <div class="panel-heading"><div><p class="panel-step">01 · DESCRIBE AND PREPARE</p><h2 id="image-compose-title">New creation</h2></div><button id="image-new" type="button" class="quiet-button" disabled>New brief</button></div>
      <p id="image-draft-source" class="draft-source" hidden></p>
      <form id="image-form">
        <label for="image-prompt">Describe the image to create <span>· your brief</span></label>
        <textarea id="image-prompt" required rows="7" aria-describedby="image-brief-counter image-brief-help" placeholder="Describe the subject, the mood and the details that matter. For an edit, say what changes and what must stay."></textarea>
        <p id="image-brief-counter" class="image-help" role="status" aria-live="polite">Brief kept: 0 / 32,000 characters · final render: 0 / 8,000.</p>
        <p id="image-brief-help" class="image-help">Paste your whole prompt or describe your idea here. The working brief accepts 32,000 characters. The final render’s 8,000 characters include the constraints and text instructions added by the Workshop; the counter shows the room left for your description.</p>
        <label for="image-size">Requested format</label>
        <select id="image-size">
          <option value="1024,1024">Square · 1024 × 1024 · 1.05 MP</option>
          <option value="1280,768">Landscape · 1280 × 768 · 0.98 MP</option>
          <option value="768,1280">Portrait · 768 × 1280 · 0.98 MP</option>
          <option value="512,512">Small square · 512 × 512 · 0.26 MP</option>
          <option value="2048,2048">Square · 2048 × 2048 · 4.19 MP</option>
          <option value="2048,1152">Landscape · 2048 × 1152 · 2.36 MP</option>
        </select>
        <p id="image-format-help" class="image-help"></p>
        <div id="image-advice" class="brief-assistance">
          <button id="imagex-plan" type="button" class="quiet-button" aria-describedby="imagex-planning-help">Refine my brief</button>
          <a href="#imagex" class="studio-guide-link" data-imagex-open>Advice and questions with imageX</a>
          <p class="image-help">Optional: Hermes clarifies or condenses this brief. You review its proposal before applying it; this step creates no image.</p>
          <details class="brief-plan-instruction"><summary>Specify the refinement request</summary>
            <label for="imagex-plan-instruction">Instruction for Hermes <span>· optional</span></label>
            <textarea id="imagex-plan-instruction" rows="2" aria-describedby="imagex-instruction-counter" placeholder="E.g.: condense the text while keeping the composition and style."></textarea>
            <p id="imagex-instruction-counter" class="image-help" role="status">Instruction: 0 / 32,000 characters.</p>
          </details>
          <p id="imagex-planning-help" class="image-help" role="status"></p>
          <a href="#image-review" class="studio-guide-link">Check or change the recipe ↓</a>
          <p id="imagex-notice" class="image-help" role="status"></p>
          <div id="imagex-recovery" class="imagex-recovery" hidden>
            <p id="imagex-recovery-help" class="image-help"></p>
            <button id="imagex-restore-brief" type="button" class="quiet-button" hidden>Recover my saved brief</button>
            <button id="imagex-retry" type="button" class="quiet-button">Retry the refinement</button>
            <a id="imagex-use-brief" href="#image-review" class="studio-guide-link" hidden>Check my brief and create</a>
          </div>
          <button id="imagex-stop" type="button" class="quiet-button" hidden>Stop the consultation</button>
        </div>
        <%- include('image-brief-proposal') %>
        <details class="image-starters">
          <summary>A starting point for your idea</summary>
          <label for="image-starter">Choose a template</label>
          <select id="image-starter" disabled><option value="">Free brief</option></select>
          <p id="image-starter-status" class="image-help" role="status"></p>
          <div id="image-starter-details" hidden>
            <p id="image-starter-description"></p>
            <p id="image-starter-references" class="image-help"></p>
            <p id="image-starter-recipe" class="image-help"></p>
            <ul id="image-starter-tips"></ul>
            <button id="image-starter-apply" type="button" class="quiet-button" disabled>Prepare this brief</button>
            <p id="image-starter-replace" class="image-help" aria-live="polite"></p>
          </div>
        </details>
        <%- include('image-brief-constraints') %>
        <%- include('image-text-policy') %>
        <section id="image-review" class="image-review" aria-labelledby="image-review-title">
          <p class="panel-step">02 · CHECK AND CREATE</p><h3 id="image-review-title">Check what will be sent</h3>
          <p class="image-help">The brief above, its constraints and the references below are used for the render. If everything is ready, create directly.</p>
          <div class="field-heading"><label for="image-profile">Render recipe</label><span>Current configuration</span></div>
          <select id="image-profile" aria-describedby="image-recipe-summary"></select>
          <details class="recipe-description"><summary>Understand the selected recipe</summary>
            <div id="image-recipe-summary" class="recipe-summary" aria-live="polite"><p>Reading the available recipes…</p></div>
            <details class="recipe-components"><summary>See the model components</summary><dl id="image-components"></dl></details>
            <div class="studio-host"><span class="studio-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span><div><span class="studio-host-label">Local compute</span><strong id="image-host">Reading the configuration…</strong><span id="image-gpu"></span></div></div>
          </details>
          <details class="seed-settings"><summary>Seed and reproducibility</summary>
            <label for="image-seed">Seed <span>optional</span></label><input id="image-seed" type="number" min="0" max="9007199254740991" step="1" placeholder="Random if empty">
            <p class="image-help">A seed lets you find the settings again. To preserve a chosen composition, attach its image as a reference.</p>
          </details>
          <div class="references-section"><div class="field-heading"><label for="image-references">References for this request</label><span>2 maximum</span></div>
            <p class="image-help">Add a photo to transform or use a creation from the library.</p>
            <div id="image-selected-reference" class="selected-reference" hidden></div>
            <input id="image-references" type="file" accept="image/png,image/jpeg" multiple>
            <div id="image-reference-previews"></div>
            <p id="image-reference-help" class="image-help">Without an attached reference, the model creates a new composition.</p>
            <button id="imagex-inspect-references" type="button" class="quiet-button" aria-describedby="imagex-inspection-help" disabled>Inspect selected references</button>
            <p id="imagex-inspection-help" class="image-help" role="status">Attach one or two images to inspect them before refining the brief. Applying a proposal and creating an image remain separate actions.</p>
          </div>
          <%- include('image-layout-guide') %>
          <details id="image-render-preview" class="result-details" hidden><summary>Reread the final brief with its constraints</summary><pre id="image-render-prompt"></pre></details>
          <p id="image-create-help" class="image-help" role="status"></p>
          <button type="submit" id="image-create" aria-describedby="image-create-help" disabled><span id="image-create-label">Create a new image</span><span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></button>
        </section>
      </form>
      <div class="image-progress"><p id="image-status" role="status" aria-live="polite">Connecting to the service…</p>
        <ol id="image-stages" aria-label="Generation stages" hidden><li>Preparation</li><li>Computation</li><li>Archiving</li><li>Restoration</li></ol>
        <div class="operation-actions"><button id="image-cancel" type="button" hidden>Cancel this generation</button><button id="image-recover" type="button" hidden>Check and recover</button></div>
      </div>
    </section>
    <section id="image-result" class="image-result" aria-labelledby="image-result-title">
      <div class="panel-heading"><div><p class="panel-step">03 · REVIEW AND IMPROVE</p><h2 id="image-result-title">Your next result</h2></div><span id="image-result-origin" class="origin-badge" hidden></span></div>
      <p id="image-preview-help" class="image-help">Create from your brief or select an image from the library to review it.</p>
      <div class="image-canvas"><div id="image-placeholder"><span aria-hidden="true">✦</span><p>Your next result appears here.<br>You can also view a kept creation.</p></div><img id="image-output" alt="Locally generated image" hidden></div>
      <dl id="image-result-facts" class="result-facts" hidden></dl>
      <div class="result-actions"><a id="image-download" class="quiet-button" hidden download>Download the original</a><button id="image-reuse-brief" type="button" class="quiet-button" hidden>Reuse the brief and settings</button><button id="image-use-reference" type="button" class="reference-button" hidden>Attach this image to edit it</button></div>
      <p id="image-improve-help" class="image-help" hidden>Review the details and your constraints. Attach this image to prepare an edit, or add exact text with the editor.</p>
      <button id="image-text-open" type="button" class="quiet-button">Reopen a JSON text project</button>
      <%- include('image-text-editor') %>
      <%- include('image-compare') %>
      <%- include('image-protected-composition') %>
      <p id="image-result-note" class="image-help" hidden></p>
      <details id="image-result-details" class="result-details" hidden><summary>Brief and recipe of this image</summary><p id="image-saved-prompt"></p><dl id="image-saved-recipe"></dl></details>
      <details id="image-export" class="result-details" hidden>
        <summary>Export the recipe and its images</summary>
        <p>The export contains your brief, the recorded graph and the reference images. The originals keep their embedded metadata, including location if present. Choose who you share these files with. It keeps the record of this creation; the weights and software needed to reproduce it elsewhere still need to be checked.</p>
        <button id="image-export-prepare" type="button" class="quiet-button">Prepare the downloads</button>
        <p id="image-export-status" role="status"></p><div id="image-export-links"></div>
      </details>
    </section>
  </div>
  <%- include('image-expert') %>
  <section class="image-history" aria-labelledby="image-library-title">
    <div class="library-heading"><div><p class="panel-step">LIBRARY</p><h2 id="image-library-title">Kept creations</h2><p>Clicking opens a preview. To prepare another request, then choose “Reuse the brief” or “Attach this image”.</p></div><label class="library-search" for="image-search">Filter creations<input id="image-search" type="search" placeholder="Model, date, dimensions…"></label></div>
    <p id="image-gallery-count" class="image-help"></p><div id="image-gallery"></div>
  </section>
</main>
